位。曹芳嘉平五年癸酉九月十七日崩。謚號道王。","en":"The second king of Geumgwan Gaya (Garak State). His father was King Suro, and his mother was Heo Hwang-ok, he was one of his father's ten sons. His queen consort was Mujeong (daughter of Minister of the Treasury Shin Bo), and his son was the third ruler, King Mapum. He ascended the throne on the 13th day of the 3rd month in the 4th year of Jianan (Jimao) under Emperor Xian of Han. He died on the 17th day of the 9th month in the 5th year of Jiaping (Guiyou) under Cao Fang. His posthumous title was King Do.","jp":"金官伽耶（駕洛国）の第2代王。父は首露王、母は許黄玉。首露王の10人の子のひとり。王妃は慕貞（泉府卿・申輔の娘）で、子は第3代王の麻品王。後漢の献帝の建安4年（己卯）3月13日に即位し、曹芳の嘉平5年（癸酉）9月17日に崩御した。諡号は道王。","kr":"금관가야(가락국)의 제2대 왕. 아버지는 수로왕, 어머니는 허황옥이다. 수로왕의 열 아들 중 한 명이다. 왕비는 모정(천부경 신보의 딸)이며, 아들은 제3대 왕인 마품왕이다. 후한 헌제 건안 4년 기묘 3월 13일에 즉위하였고, 조위 조방 가평 5년 계유 9월 17일에 붕어하였다. 시호는 도왕이다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1050215","remark":"普武","surname":"金","surnameTc":"金","surnameEn":"Kim","surnameJp":"金","surnameKr":"금","surnameOther":"","name":"居登","nameTc":"居登","nameEn":"Geodeung","nameJp":"居登","nameKr":"거등","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"金居登","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"190","city":"CS1068","gender":"0","rule":"52","force":"55","wise":"54","politics":"54","charm":"55","will":"57","ruleTalent":"7","forceTalent":"7","wiseTalent":"5","politicsTalent":"6","charmTalent":"7","willTalent":"7","weaponMaster":"29/29/55/32/32/27/33/33","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"2200","battleSoulPoint":"1700","debateSoulPoint":"3000","strategy":"","strategy2":"1008501","professions":"2/3/3/2/0/0/2/0/1/1/0/0/2/2